IGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">- <font color=\"#ff007f\"><strong>기</strong><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong>간 :&nbsp;</strong></font></span><strong>&nbsp;2018.06.15(금) ~ 06.22(금)</strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"><strong>- <font color=\"#ff007f\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">실시 방법 :</font> </font>학교홈페이지 - 원스톱 서비스 로그인 - 왼쪽 하단 메뉴에 실태조사 실시</strong></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -2.1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">또한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">앞으로의 대학 교육 방향에 대한 계획을 수립하는 데에 기초자료로 활용할 예정이오니 성실한 답변바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: -2.1pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수집된 자료는 오직 연구목적으로만 활용되며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">공개되지 않습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: